	quest.68781BE49ACAF57E.quest_desc: [
		"&2Welcome to Space Race 5 by MuggleOrWizard! &r"
		""
		"The end goal of this pack is to make it to space and explore the different planets in the solar system!"
		""
		"These quests will guide you throught the different mods in this pack. Complete quests to obtain rewards. The quests don't cover every aspect of every mod, so make sure to experiment! "
		""
		"JEI will be your friend in exploring what these mods have to offer. FTB Ultimine is included in this pack -> just hold your selected keybind to veinmine. "
		""
		"Questions? Join the Discord!"
		""
		"&4You do not have to finish a chapter before moving on to the next!&r"
	]
